":3871499031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mwmMX","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T12:44:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T13:04:32Z","body":"I have fixed the mapping issue, but I think this PR would definitely conflict with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114642 , not sure if a controller that was opened with the GameInput driver can be used with DirectInput haptic effects.\r\nMatter of fact, controller hotplugging for DirectInput controllers in GameInput doesn't work if DirectInput is enabled. If it's disabled then everything is okay.\r\n\r\nMaybe if we decide to use GameInput *instead* of DirectInput, I or someone else would have to create an SDL haptic driver for GameInput :(\r\n\r\nAnd also GameInput doesn't support retrieving input from devices if the application is not in focus, unless I can do something with it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3871499031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_