intorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T12:45:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T14:43:29Z","body":"Here's something that I observed when I added several `printf` calls in `joystick/gdk/SDL_gameinputjoystick.c`: GameInput doesn't tell us the names of the connected devices (`info->deviceStrings` and `info->displayName` are `NULL`, doesn't matter whether it's an XInput device or not), which means currently we basically have to use DirectInput for non-gamepad controllers unless we want to only rely on controller mappings to get the controller names (which means unmapped controllers won't get a human-readable name). :(\r\n\r\nAnd I'm pretty sure that XInput controllers other than the ones from Xbox don't have a human-readable name in this PR either. I don't have other XInput controllers to check that though. In this case, what name should we assign to those controllers: \"XInput Controller # ..\" to not break compatibility or \"GameInput Controller\"?\r\n\r\nEDIT: I decided to use \"GameInput Gamepad\", I will add a new commit here soon.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977120422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4004637161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116055#issuecomment-4004637161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116055","id":4004637161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7usenp","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T12:13:23Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T12:15:54Z","body":"Now that I think about it, is it possible to check later if this PR breaks Xbox controllers in Windows Godot apps under Wine or Proton?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4004637161/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008057241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116055#issuecomment-4008057241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116055","id":4008057241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u5hmZ","user":{"login":"AL2009man"